# Instagram

Stage 1 loads `@efemer_flowers` and `@himmlhaus` into **`ingest_items`** (idempotent on `account:shortcode`). Then `KeywordIngest` → optional `MaterializePosts` (see `ingest.mdc`). Soft `kind` and invitations come from Gemini, not PHP heuristics.

**Prefer Instaloader dump + `ImportInstagramDump` when the archive API is 429.** Production `instagram-archive` loop stays **off**.

## Session

Store Jan’s Instagram `sessionid` in Secret Manager (never commit it):

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| Project | `efemer-456414` |
| Secret | `instagram-session-id` |
| Accessor | `efemer-storage@efemer-456414.iam.gserviceaccount.com` |

Runtime reads GSM first, then `.secret/instagram.session`. Local file is seeded into GSM when GSM is empty.

Refresh the secret when Instagram checkpoints the session:

```bash
printf '%s' "$SESSIONID" | gcloud secrets versions add instagram-session-id \
  --project=efemer-456414 --account=jablunka@gmail.com --data-file=-
```

## Run (ingest jobs)

Prefer `./bin/job` (TTY) so Ctrl+C kills the job:

```bash
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"efemer_flowers","full":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"himmlhaus","full":true}' -f

# both accounts
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagramAccounts --args='{"full":true}' -f

# offline dump under data/instagram (Archiver layout OR Instaloader)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ImportInstagramDump -f
```

On HTTP 429 the client waits (60s → … capped at 15m, up to 8 attempts, honors `Retry-After`) then retries; Ctrl+C still interrupts waits. Browser OK ≠ archive API unthrottled. **Do not keep re-running RefreshInstagram while 429 persists** — it deepens the throttle.

### Bypass when API is rate-limited: Instaloader

`ImportInstagramDump` also reads native Instaloader dumps (`data/instagram/{account}/*_UTC.json.xz` + jpgs). Local venv: `tmp/instagram-venv`.

```bash
# stop if a RefreshInstagram backoff is still running
./bin/job jobs:kill -f

cd ~/Sites/efemer
mkdir -p data/instagram
# anonymous often works when session archive API is 429’d
# omit --fast-update for a first full dump (it stops at the first already-downloaded post)
tmp/instagram-venv/bin/instaloader \
  --no-videos \
  --dirname-pattern 'data/instagram/{profile}' \
  --filename-pattern '{date_utc}_UTC' \
  efemer_flowers himmlhaus

./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ImportInstagramDump -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest -f
```
